{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/statistics/national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-3","content_id":"87a0644d-a08e-4913-9de8-242ec99db163","description":"Public attitudes towards travel and transport study on a series of questions asked towards a variety of travel and transport.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"webmasterdft@dft.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5f2417c2e90e071a597ba469","filename":"national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-3.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":596170,"filename":"national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-3.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"4403896","isbn":"","number_of_pages":14,"title":"National Travel Attitudes Study (NTAS): Wave 3 report","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5f2417c2e90e071a597ba469/national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-3.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"webmasterdft@dft.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5f2417fad3bf7f1b13f64fa3","filename":"national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-3.zip"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/zip","file_size":197913,"filename":"national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-3.zip","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"4403902","isbn":"","title":"National Travel Attitudes Study (NTAS): Wave 3 data tables","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5f2417fad3bf7f1b13f64fa3/national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-3.zip"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"4413649","isbn":"","title":"National Travel Attitudes Study, England: Wave 3 pre-release access","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/statistics/national-travel-attitudes-study-wave-3/national-travel-attitudes-study-england-wave-3-pre-release-access"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Statistics on attitudes around travel and transport issues, asked of people who have completed the main National Travel Survey.</p>\n\n<p>Questions in wave 3 were put to 2,694 individuals and includes responses on a wide array of topics, including:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>active transport (e.g. walking and cycling)</li>\n  <li>road journeys and the environment</li>\n  <li>road congestion</li>\n  <li>road safety</li>\n  <li>public transport</li>\n  <li>transport and disability</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Headline figures include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>48% of respondents are concerned about poor air quality in their immediate area</li>\n  <li>40% of respondents are concerned about noise pollution in their immediate area</li>\n  <li>61% of respondents have heard of carbon offsetting</li>\n  <li>among respondents who are planning to purchase a new bicycle, 32% say they are likely to purchase an e-bike</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"contact-us\">Contact us</h2>\n<div class=\"contact contact\" id=\"contact_1340\">\n    <p class=\"govuk-body\">National Travel Survey statistics</p>\n\n\n    <div>\n        <p class=\"govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-4\">\n          Email <a class=\"govuk-link\" href=\"mailto:national.travelsurvey@dft.gov.uk\">national.travelsurvey@dft.gov.uk</a>\n        </p>\n\n\n    </div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2020-08-05T08:30:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Official Statistics","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;file_download&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.g